Package: millsratio
Title: Interactive Analysis of Mills Ratios and Tail Thickness
Version: 0.2.3
Authors@R: 
    person("John", "Gavin", , "john.b.gavin@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Compute and compare Mills ratios for normal, t, and exponential
    distributions. Explore the t(30) paradox where heavier tails produce
    larger Mills ratios despite near-normal density. Includes an interactive
    Shiny dashboard for visualising tail behaviour and hazard functions.
